* The right to receive goods within a reasonable time frame.
* The right to return goods that are faulty or not as described within a reasonable time frame.
* The right to be informed about the rights and remedies available under the act.
* The right to receive clear and concise information about the goods and services being provided.
* The right to be treated fairly and reasonably by traders.
* The right to challenge unfair terms and conditions in contracts.
* The right to receive compensation for losses caused by breaches of the act.

