It also defines three relationships:

- `hasMany('cars')`: This relationship indicates that each user can have multiple cars.
- `hasMany('pets')`: This relationship indicates that each user can have multiple pets.
- `hasOne('house')`: This relationship indicates that each user can have only one house.

